 "remarks": "4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | 3,208 Square Feet  Welcome to 71 Blackberry Drive, where contemporary updates meet exceptional design. While the field card lists the property as 2 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, the home currently offers 4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, providing substantially more space and functionality than the public record reflects. The total gross living area, including the finished lower level, is 3,208 square feet, comprised of: 1,367 sq. ft. in the lower level, 1,486 sq. ft. on the first floor, 355 sq. ft. on the second floor.  This beautifully renovated home features a dramatic open-concept floor plan with soaring vaulted ceilings, exposed wood beams, and expansive living and dining spaces filled with natural light. The custom kitchen is equipped with premium cabinetry, quartzite countertops, a large center island, a farmhouse sink, and stainless-steel appliances, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.  Additional highlights include stylishly updated bathrooms, spacious bedrooms, and quality finishes throughout, reflecting extensive improvements such as a new roof (2023), updated windows and doors, newer HVAC, and numerous interior upgrades. Step outside to multiple decks and patio areas overlooking a private, wooded setting, perfect for outdoor gatherings or relaxation. Completing the property is an oversized paver driveway, attached garage, and a convenient location with easy access to shopping, dining, parks and major commuting rout",
